    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051123.0245\n\nNAIROBI, Nov. 23 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nUrgent: Kenyan president dissolves cabinet\n\n\n\n\nKenyan President Mwai Kibaki Wednesday dissolved his entire cabinet, a day after the proposed draft constitution was rejected in a referendum. He said the new lineup will be announced in two weeks.",
